                                    style="position: relative; width: 100%; height: 30 px; border: 2px solid red; background-color: #FFFF00; color: #FF0000; text-align: center"><h1 style="color: #FF0000;">LC Authority and Vocabulary Service Error/Maintenance!</h1><br/> 
